<h2>Thursday, June 24,  2004</h2>	
<div class="post">
	 <h3 class="storytitle" id="post-26"><a href="http://www.marksportal.net/index.php?p=26" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link: It&#8217;s Been Awhile">It&#8217;s Been Awhile</a></h3>
	<div class="meta">posted by: Mark @ 11:55 pm </div>
	
	<div id="wplinks" class="storycontent">
			<p>I&#8217;ve been meaning to post for awhile but things just have been too busy.    Let&#8217;s see&#8230;.what has happened since I&#8217;ve last posted.   Well, I mentioned that I bought a grill.  This last weekend I had a friend come over and show me how to make steaks.  They were VERY good!  <img src='http://www.marksportal.net/wp/wp-images/smilies/icon_smile.gif' alt=':)' />  We grilled up some steaks, potatoes, and corn on the cob.   The steaks were pretty spicy, but we all liked it.   So we all had a fun time doing that.   I haven&#8217;t been much of a cook.   Most my &#8220;grown up&#8221; life I&#8217;ve relied on fast food and microwave dinners.   However this last week I&#8217;ve dived into trying to cook the easier items:  Chili, Spaghetti, hamburgers, and steaks.  I hope to try cooking some teriyaki chicken and fish soon.  Perhaps this next week.   I&#8217;m discovering that cooking isn&#8217;t as hard as it initially seemed.  I guess that&#8217;s true with most things though.</p>
	<p>In other news&#8230;I&#8217;ve been obsessing about some things.  Things I wish I didn&#8217;t obsess about.  It&#8217;s quite irratating actually.   I&#8217;m finding that every time my life starts to get balanced, something pops up that I obsess over which throws me off balance.  I think this obsession is starting to leave though, at which point things should balance out again.   Hopefully I&#8217;ll be a bit more aware of it before it pops up again.</p>
	</div>
	
